  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 502.13 Lower explosive limit (LEL)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 502.13 “Lower explosive limit (LEL)” means the lowest concentration of a gas or vapor percentage by volume in air that burns or explodes if an ignition source is present at ambient temperature.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 500) #10229, eff 11-17-12; ss by #13458, eff 10-7-22",
